{"id": "DekRIWBSKRH", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Every drop of Raktabeej's blood stood up as another Raktabeej, until Durga's anger came out of her forehead as a goddess darker than the night. \nMaa Kalaratri, the fiercest and still the most auspicious, told as Tholu Bommalata, Andhra's leather shadow puppets 🪔\n\nShe rides a donkey, the humblest of animals, because her protection reaches even the lowest.\n\nNavdurga, Day 7, Part 1 of 3. Part 2: who stopped her? Part 3: what the Devi Mahatmya says 👀 \nEvery puppet, every lightning crack and every drop is animated frame by frame. Lamp light, sticks and all.\n\nSend this to the friend who turns into Kalaratri when someone messes with their people 🖤\n\nHappy Navratri 🙏\n\n#navdurga #maakalaratri #raktabeej #tholubommalata #shadowpuppet", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792178468, "like_count": 41606, "comment_count": 140, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1925204888844424a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 56.835, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNc_fWXi6YbEdCcRW0iff3THlo019MCik33XOPKZUAOxCDw1bHMEMRnjJh9hQOL6YbO3BB8Fpt2S6zr47HZyxpz-AYvHM-3GOh6cMk.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpaL0g9sGIe4CWCjUkFSYV-ussklU5FLKJ99xemYxe_V5jrOvjzy0VwJ7esQIYmRHgxEl7Ig1_EXLUzFwInOicR&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=2ppAX2uTCGEQ7kNvwFtNLH9&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=RlBrMGgcojuzFMrzhilMwg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQbbNIRcyTJKJCeeuRf3ahHP_J